WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.730
This story is one that lightly describes the ordinary daily lives of the three Minami sisters.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.340
Please don't expect too much from it.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.300
Also, watch in a bright room,

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.990
and stay 3 meters away from the TV while watching.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:22.370
Kana

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:22.710
Chiaki

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:23.500
Haruka

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:50.040
Hosaka

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:53.080
I see.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:56.170
It's true after all.

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.200
Yeah.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.180
Today, I'm going to Haruka's house.

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:06.100
Is that so?

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:10.650
What a bother. Today, eh?

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:13.570
Erm... Hosaka-senpai?

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:17.300
The ones who are going are Hayami-senpai, Atsuko and I.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.740
You aren't invited.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.810
That's for sure.

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:26.360
I haven't even talked to Minami Haruka before.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.500
There's no reason to invite me.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:32.430
<i>Phew. I see that even this person would understand something as simple as this.</i>

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:34.430
But, what a bother!

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.720
Before I can get invited, I'll need to befriend her first.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:48.930
How should I start talking to her...

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.900
What should I talk about...

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:55.520
There isn't much time before school dismisses.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.250
I have to take action in a systematic way.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:03.750
Could you perhaps be thinking about becoming friends with her before school ends today?

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.240
That's for certain.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.570
Maki!

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.230
Hayami-senpai! Can I have a moment?

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:20.460
Why did you tell that guy about that?

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:21.590
About what?

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:24.300
That we're going to Haruka-chan's house?

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.600
That person wants to come along as well.

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:29.230
Again? How come?

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.240
He's...

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:34.940
Got his eyes on Haruka!

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:45.320
Why did you keep something so interesting from me?

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.370
Interesting? No, no!

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:49.990
I'll go call Haruka here!

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:55.780
She's hopeless! I can't depend on Hayami-senpai.

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:58.280
I have to protect Haruka!

00:03:58.280 --> 00:03:59.800
From those arms of Satan!

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:04.900
Erm... Hosaka-senpai!

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:07.640
"A fated encounter in the rain" Chapter
Hosaka's Simulation

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:25.160
And that's when Minami Haruka blushes.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:29.620
That's when I give a charming smile.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.560
It's perfect.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.760
<i>Gross.</i>

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.050
Haruka-chan!

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:39.520
Hayami-senpai.

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:40.880
What's the matter?

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.640
Over here, over here. Come!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.640
"A date in the snowy park" Chapter
Hosaka's Simulation

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:10.330
That's when Minami Haruka shifted her gaze downwards.

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:13.500
And that's when I will embrace her.

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.460
The problem comes after that.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.280
The problem...

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:26.930
Erm... That's a simulation to become friends with her, right?

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:31.680
Maki.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.960
"I love ya" and "I love you". Which sounds better?

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:38.270
Is there any difference?

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:40.550
Of course there is! A big difference!

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:41.680
Do you understand?

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:46.900
I love ya!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.640
I love you!

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:54.060
They're completely different.

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:56.990
I love ya.

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:57.790
I love you.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:05:59.380
I love ya.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.420
I love you.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.250
I love ya.

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:03.710
I love you.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.320
I love ya.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:06.820
I love you.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:13.560
It's not like that!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.310
I love ya.

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.600
I love you.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:16.270
I love ya.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.240
I love you.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:21.390
Alright, that's the end of my practice.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.770
There isn't much time before school ends.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.280
I love ya!

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:28.380
I'm back.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.760
How troublesome.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.180
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.870
Well, I can't help myself.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.650
I'm not chewing it enough, eh?

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.910
Ouch!

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:34.220
I bit the inside of my mouth!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.090
Stop that!

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:50.080
Don't look at me like you're looking at something pitiful!

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:53.490
No, you're not pitiful, you're pathetic.

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:59.720
After being made fun of by this gum, I hurt my mouth.

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:03.920
Not only that, I also got looked down upon by my own sister...

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:05.940
How humiliating!

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:08.090
It's the most humiliating thing this season!

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:13.260
I'll teach you how to blow a big one.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.790
So don't cry anymore.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:18.270
All right, look closely.

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:29.730
What are you doing?

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.490
Well, I can't help myself.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:34.570
Okay, it's intensive training from now on!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.530
Yes, Master!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:06.090
You really have no talent for blowing bubblegum.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:08.090
Sorry.

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:11.730
There's no helping you. I'll show you one more time.

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:23.570
Cut it out already.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:26.530
I'm home.

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:29.970
Welcome back, Haruka-neesama.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:37.510
Oh!

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:41.760
Bubblegum? How rare.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:51.980
Even Haruka?!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:59.410
That's not right. That's not just a normal bubble.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:10.350
Blowing another bubble inside a bubble... such a high-level technique.

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:12.340
That's Haruka-neesama for you.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.300
Godly Technique

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:19.340
This is... a godly technique.
Godly Technique

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:23.010
This is... a godly technique.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.720
A godly technique?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:38.650
Godly technique.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.920
O Lord, why didst thou stoppeth?!

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:49.670
Haruka-neesama, please show us your godly technique once more!

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.470
Let's have dinner.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.650
Delicious!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.970
Haruka's lunchbox...

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:25.230
What?!

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:27.830
You say that Minami Haruka is excellent at cooking?

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:31.750
Yup. I often go and steal some of her food.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.290
It's really tasty!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:36.940
How nice... How nice...

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:40.250
How about you go and ask her to share it with you?

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:43.290
Well... You haven't really talked to Haruka-chan before.

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:46.430
I guess it's impossible for a vain and cowardly person like you.

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:50.670
Don't describe me with those words!

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:56.100
Hurry up and tackle her head-on!

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.690
Don't slap me so hard!

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:01.220
Head-on! Clash! Rattle! Clatter!

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:02.650
What sounds are those?

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:06.070
C'mon, Hosaka! Show me what you've got!

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:08.070
The "C" in C'mon is also "C" for Charm!

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.650
Alright! Leave it to me!

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:17.810
<i>He's calling.</i>

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:22.480
<i>Maki isn't here... He's obviously calling for me.</i>

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.790
Minami Haruka isn't here?

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:33.860
She isn't.

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:38.060
I see... And I even put effort into finding a common conversational topic.

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:39.930
Common conversational topic?

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:42.730
About cooking.

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:46.910
Hosaka-senpai, you like cooking?

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:48.700
Starting from today, yes.

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:54.410
If Minami Haruka says cooking is fun, it has to be fun.

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:58.130
Minami Haruka's words are absolute truth.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:08.080
If she says crows are white, I'll dye all the crows in this world white just for her!

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:54.220
<i>Perhaps this person...</i>

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:57.720
<i>...is rather cool after all.</i>

00:13:58.710 --> 00:13:59.470
<i>But...</i>

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:03.100
<i>This certainly isn't the time to get undressed.</i>

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.580
Maybe bleaching is better?

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.690
Hosaka-senpai, everything's showing.

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:12.310
So where's Minami Haruka?

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.510
She went with Maki to buy bread.

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:20.180
What? Doesn't Minami Haruka bring her own lunchbox?

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:22.290
Well, today...

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:26.250
If she only eats bread every day, won't she be lacking in nourishment?!

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:29.450
Hayami-senpai ate everything....

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:33.510
Leave it to me, one who has just discovered the wonderful world of cooking!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.340
Like I said... Erm...

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:38.050
Just watch, Minami Haruka!

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:41.380
<i>Listen to what I have to say...</i>

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:47.510
Hayami-senpai, you're going to eat more after finishing Haruka's lunchbox?

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:50.560
Maki, you should eat more and grow up faster.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.290
The Next Day

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:07.240
Eh? Hosaka, you brought a lunchbox today?

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:10.470
Why are there two of the same kind of lunchbox?

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:13.100
Looks delicious.

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.380
This is a French-style lunchbox.

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.830
Ah, delicious.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:27.890
This won't do. I can't let her taste this yet.

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:32.250
This method of boiling red wine, dried grapes, sauté, and even me myself,

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:33.610
Everything is too naïve.

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:38.570
Putting tarragon and yellow cucumber in mushroom broth is too much!

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.180
You made it yourself?

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:47.210
I must make her the supreme lunchbox.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:48.920
I MUST!

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:53.010
Monday

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:57.780
Kana!

00:15:57.780 --> 00:15:59.470
What is the meaning of this?!

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:01.040
Eh? What?

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:03.270
The rice cooker is empty!

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:06.530
Huh? That's weird.

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.060
I thought I added rice and switched it on.

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:11.750
What do we do now?

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:15.830
What are you going to do about this outstretched rice bowl?

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:17.450
I'll put it away for you.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:23.220
I won't have any strength if I don't eat rice on Monday morning...

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:26.540
I should have checked...

00:16:26.850 --> 00:16:28.400
We still have bread.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:31.820
I know that! I know there's bread!

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:33.100
Shall I toast it?

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:34.970
Do it now!

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:44.630
What's wrong with Haruka?

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:47.950
She said she didn't eat any rice, so she doesn't have any strength.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:49.320
Oh I see!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.320
Haruka-chan is starving?

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.650
Hayami-senpai?!

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:02.070
Hosaka looks pretty cute as long as he keeps quiet.

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:03.480
Really?

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:12.990
<i>Put salt into the boiling water.</i>

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.540
<i>Drop in the pasta.</i>

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.340
<i>Stir it.</i>

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.680
He's weird even when he doesn't speak.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:35.840
Hosaka, Hosaka!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.570
What's up?

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.140
I heard Haruka-chan is starving.

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:41.270
What?!

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:45.690
I prepare two lunchboxes every day in case of rainy days like this!

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:47.940
I wonder if she's on a diet?

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.110
What are you talking about?

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:54.290
I'm sure Minami Haruka knows the importance of healthy eating.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.760
Besides, even if she gets fatter...

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:57.670
Even if she gets fatter?

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:01.090
I will think of a menu to help her lose weight in a healthy way!

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:02.740
No, let's think of it together!

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:06.060
Then both of our dreams will arise from this, won't it?!

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:09.630
Hosaka, wake up from your dreams...

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:17.040
Okay! Time for lunch!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:19.050
Ho-Hosa-

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:23.930
<i>I can feel he's up to something creepy again...</i>

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:27.750
Haruka.

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:32.870
I brought some rice balls. Want some?

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:35.650
No way. Sorry about this.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:38.450
Take off the foil first.

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:43.420
How is it?

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:46.720
Delicious!

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:03.620
<i>He's leaving.</i>

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:08.010
<i>There's no need for me to make an appearance.</i>

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:11.500
<i>As long as she eats properly and smiles like always...</i>

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.830
There's no problem!

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.300
I'm back!

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:18.460
What are you doing, you dumbass?!

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:23.290
What's wrong?

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:25.330
Welcome back, Neesama.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:27.160
Kana cooked rice.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:30.420
Eh?! But Mondays are always pasta nights.

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:33.630
I was thinking you might want rice...

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:35.650
No problem!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:38.740
Super Roman

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:58.130
Super Roman

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:04.520
Welcome! Welcome! It's cheap!

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:07.090
We've received a fresh stock of fish today!

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:17.770
"Where bliss lies" Chapter
Hosaka's Simulation

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.190
It should be almost ready.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:39.810
The cod, tofu, mushroom, and cabbage all belong to me, you dumbass.

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:44.550
Hey, hey, are you telling me, Kana-sama, to eat wild vegetables?

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:50.400
You should say grace first, my daughters.

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:51.950
Here, Darling.

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:54.850
Thanks, Haruka.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:03.940
My daughters!

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:08.900
Everyone...

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:14.620
No good.

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:19.610
Even if I use this ingredient, the Minami Haruka in my heart doesn't smile.

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:22.580
Just wait, Minami Haruka!

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:27.360
I'll definitely make you the ultimate lunchbox!

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:30.800
I will! Definitely!

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:34.130
And it was really fun.

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:36.360
I will! Definitely!

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:38.250
Mister, don't do that!
I will! Definitely!

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:38.660
Definitely!
Mister, don't do that!

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:40.260
Mister...
Definitely!

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:46.820
Gross.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:50.240
Super Roman

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:59.960
Let's have sukiyaki today!

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:30.640
Next Episode

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:32.430
Oh? You want talk to me about Minami Haruka's charm?
Next Episode

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:33.390
Oh? You want talk to me about Minami Haruka's charm?

00:23:33.390 --> 00:23:34.490
No, the preview...

00:23:34.490 --> 00:23:35.250
I'll begin with my introspection first.

00:23:35.250 --> 00:23:36.180
I was born because of the red thread tying my little finger to Haruka!

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:37.850
Listen to what I have to-

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:38.470
I was born because of the red thread tying my little finger to Haruka!

